er-attachments/assets/35972360-9042-401a-9545-e94769da294e","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","The creator’s rifle-combat screenshot.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/astra-floor-ai.webp","alt","Astra Floor rifle combat against a zombie wave, with health, ammunition and wave counters.","https://github.com/MartinDelophy/awesome-gpt-6-astra/issues/96","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[93,94],"ChatGPT","Antigravity","相关资源",[99],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":100,"_25":101},"Three.js","/zh/resources/threejs/","创作者开发记录",[105],"evidence",{"_62":106,"_25":82,"_107":108},"查看作者说明的 AI 分工","note","The repository owner’s submission distinguishes Astra from Antigravity work. The README also credits both tools; no full conversation archive is supplied.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[113],{"_62":114,"_25":115,"_107":116},"查看完整 FPS 游戏项目","https://github.com/BEROCHLU/astrafloor","Game implementation, procedural models, bundled textures/music and tests. Node.js 22.13+; npm install then npm run dev. Third-party texture credits are documented separately.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[122],{"_62":123,"_25":124,"_107":125},"Play Astra Floor","https://astrafloor.berochlu.workers.dev/","Desktop WebGL, keyboard and mouse. Wait for INITIALIZING to finish, choose a difficulty, then DEPLOY. WASD moves, mouse aims/fires, R reloads, Q heals, G throws a grenade, and V uses melee. Runs are not saved. The in-app browser could not capture the mouse during review; a normal desktop browser is recommended.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[133],{"_62":134,"_25":82,"_107":-7},"阅读作者的 AI 开发说明","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[139,140,141,142],"Choose Normal difficulty and enter the first wave.","Read the creator’s architecture and model disclosure.","Inspect procedural weapons, enemies and audio implementation.","Tune one weapon or enemy and verify a wave and shop transition.","AI 工作流与开发背景","BEROCHLU 表示 GPT-6 Astra 参与了大量架构、程序化 3D 生成和 Web Audio 合成，Antigravity 2.0 完成其他实现与迭代打磨。作者没有宣称这是一次提示完成的作品。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Three.js · TypeScript (React UI)","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[139,140,141,142],{"_62":172,"_25":82,"_17":129},{"_62":123,"_25":124,"_17":118,"_107":125},{"_62":169,"_25":115,"_170":171,"_107":116},{"_62":168,"_25":82,"_107":108},[167],"threejs","Read the author’s division of AI work","Open the complete FPS project","scope","complete-project","Read the creator’s AI development disclosure",{"_174":175},"documents",{"_74":176,"_35":177},[179,183,184,185,182,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,181,218,180,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239],[178,179,180,181,182],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","design/design-system","design/v2/design-system","edi